       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPOUNDINTEREST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRINCIPAL    PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
       01 RATE         PIC 9V999 VALUE 0.050.
       01 YEARS        PIC 9(2) VALUE 10.
       01 AMOUNT       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE AMOUNT ROUNDED =
               PRINCIPAL * ((1 + RATE) ** YEARS)
           DISPLAY "PRINCIPAL: " PRINCIPAL
           DISPLAY "AMOUNT AFTER " YEARS " YEARS: " AMOUNT
           STOP RUN.
